<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 30px; line-height: 32px; color: #223341;">[New Solution Release]</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 30px; line-height: 32px; color: #223341;"> Third-Party Invoicing</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">We are excited to announce expanded availability of <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/industries/education/solution/third-party-invoicing?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q2clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Flywire’s third-party invoicing solution!</u></strong></span></a></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><br />Our third-party invoicing solution helps institutions like yours easily and securely create, issue and track invoices to engage sponsors and encourage timely payments. In fact, our design and development partner institutions have seen strong results, including:</span></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">70% increase in tuition collections</span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">40% less time spent manually reconciling sponsor payments</span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">30% fewer third-party payment inquiries</span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Join our virtual <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/webinar-q2-product-insights-open-forum?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q2clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Product Insights Open Forum</u></strong></span></a> on <strong>June 11th at 2:00pm</strong> EDT to learn more. In addition to Flywire’s product team sharing a demo and overview of third-party invoicing, they will also provide roadmap updates on all of our education solutions. </span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
