<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">If you didn't know, May 29th is National 529 Day which serves as a reminder to families and friends that it has never been easier to help save for a child’s future. By contributing to a 529 savings plan, a child is prepared for whatever path they choose. Learn how Flywire helps streamline the 529 disbursement process by enabling digital payments directly to your institution.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
